        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "254. All Regular employees are eligible to participate in the Kaiser Permanente Employees Pension Plan after twelve (12) months of service. Major benefit provisions of the plan are described below. A full description of the plan is contained in a separate summary plan description distributed to all employees and a plan document is available for employee inspection.",
